From:       Valid, Frozen, Missing
To:         Valid, Missing, SameAsFrom
Amount:     Normal, ExactBalance, Zero, OverBalance
Currency:   Same, Different
DailyLimit: Empty, ExactLimit, Exceeded

# A2: [IF fromExists] — from байхгүй бол "ижил данс", үлдэгдэл, лимит гэсэн ойлголт байхгүй
IF [From] = "Missing" THEN [To] <> "SameAsFrom" AND [Amount] IN {"Normal", "Zero"} AND [DailyLimit] = "Empty";
